[7.0, "o", "> What's the weather in Mannheim?\r\n  The weather in Mannheim is 22°"]
[8.115, "o", "C and sunny, which is 71.6°F.\r\n> And what is that in Fahrenheit?\r\n  71.6°"]
[9.387, "o", "F (since 22°C equals 71.6°F).\r\n> Which city "]
[11.136, "o", "did I ask about?\r\n  Mannheim.\r\n\r\nWithout the history: Which city’s weather are you referring to? If you provide the Celsius temperature (or the city), I’ll conv"]
